office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A thermal head and a thermal head unit are provided which are small-sized and capable of producing uniform prints. A thermal head (10) comprises a head chip (20), one side of which are formed heating elements, and individual electrodes and common electrodes connected with the heating elements; and an IC chip (32) connected with the individual electrodes. The common electrode (27) is extended along the array of the heating elements on the head chip (20). A plurality of connected points between common electrodes (27) and common electrode (41) connection lines are also formed along the array of the heating elements.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une tête thermique et un ensemble tête thermique de petite dimension, permettant de produire des impressions uniformes. La tête (10) thermique comprend une plaquette (20)de tête sur un côté de laquelle sont disposés des éléments chauffants, des électrodes individuelles et des électrodes communes connectées aux éléments chauffants, et un microcircuit intégré (32) connecté aux électrodes individuelles. L'électrode (27)) commune s'étend le long de l'ensemble d'éléments chauffants sur la plaquette (20) de tête. Une pluralité de points de connexion entre les électrodes (27) communes et les lignes de connexion (41) des électrodes communes sont également formés le long des ensembles d'éléments chauffants.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>